{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Long Multiplication Calculator 是一款專為長乘法學習而設的計算工具，輸入任何數字後即可看到完整的運算步驟，並內置乘數表測驗，適合學生、家長及需要教學示範的教師使用。應用原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>逐步顯示運算過程與測驗</h2>\n<p>開啟應用後只需輸入想計算的數字，畫面便會逐步列出整段長乘法的運算過程，較大型的數字亦能處理，選項比網頁版更豐富。要熟練長乘法，先要掌握乘數表，因此應用內置乘法測驗，讓用家隨時重溫乘數表。整個操作直觀流暢，而且屬於獨立應用，離線環境下同樣可以正常使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-107-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-108-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-109-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-110-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-111-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-112-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Long Multiplication Calculator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T18:18:05.446382+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}